        <mxCell id="note1" value="Pass cfg as the SecurityXxx constructor's second argument   -   Config::key is SHA-256-truncated into a 16-byte AES-128-GCM key" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe082;strokeColor=#ef6c00;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#e65100;arcSize=10;shadow=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
